800
00:28:37,350 --> 00:28:38,130
-Yes.

801
00:28:38,130 --> 00:28:38,900
-Fine.

802
00:28:38,900 --> 00:28:39,670
-Can I borrow a couple?

803
00:28:39,670 --> 00:28:41,210
-They'll accompany you.

804
00:28:41,210 --> 00:28:41,710
-Where?

805
00:28:41,710 --> 00:28:42,410
-What does it matter.

806
00:28:42,410 --> 00:28:45,070
-Only one thing I-- Ow!

807
00:28:45,070 --> 00:28:48,290
-The essential thing is to
 keep him from coming back.

808
00:28:48,290 --> 00:28:51,380
And as for Hercules, I
 want him taken alive.

809
00:28:51,380 --> 00:28:53,960
He'll pay dearly for all
 the trouble he's caused me.

810
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:56,010
-Good night now.

811
00:28:56,010 --> 00:28:58,120
-The queen wouldn't deny
 her sister anything.

812
00:28:58,120 --> 00:28:59,010
-I know.

813
00:28:59,010 --> 00:29:02,840
And I'm here to ask her for
 the greatest favor of my life.

814
00:29:02,840 --> 00:29:05,130
-Everyone at court knows the
 only favor that will satisfy

815
00:29:05,130 --> 00:29:06,190
the princess Billis--

816
00:29:06,190 --> 00:29:07,820
-Guys, I am so
 homesick right now.

817
00:29:07,820 --> 00:29:08,320
-Uh-huh.

818
00:29:08,320 --> 00:29:08,810
-What is it?

819
00:29:08,810 --> 00:29:09,570
-Or what?

820
00:29:09,570 --> 00:29:11,580
-I must talk to you, Samara.

821
00:29:11,580 --> 00:29:12,080
-Get out.

822
00:29:12,080 --> 00:29:14,200
-OK, I'll come back later.

823
00:29:14,200 --> 00:29:15,480
-Hey, it's a Flintstone phone.

824
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:18,460
-I want you to promise
 that you'll hear me out.

825
00:29:18,460 --> 00:29:21,160
-I'll hear you out that
 door is what I'll do.

826
00:29:21,160 --> 00:29:22,940
-Haven't I always done so?

827
00:29:22,940 --> 00:29:25,450
-Marlow Thomas is that queen.

828
00:29:25,450 --> 00:29:26,940
-Don't you really
 believe I'm fond of you?

829
00:29:26,940 --> 00:29:28,510
-Don't say that, Samara.

830
00:29:28,510 --> 00:29:30,710
Even if we didn't
 have the same mother,

831
00:29:30,710 --> 00:29:33,620
you've always been
 a good sister to me.

832
00:29:33,620 --> 00:29:35,200
And I'm grateful.

833
00:29:35,200 --> 00:29:38,630
-I want it to be perfectly clear
 that my attitude is dictated

834
00:29:38,630 --> 00:29:40,650
solely by my affection for you.

835
00:29:40,650 --> 00:29:41,600
-Of course.

836
00:29:41,600 --> 00:29:43,240
And because of
 that affection you

837
00:29:43,240 --> 00:29:45,530
could make me the happiest
 woman in the world.

838
00:29:45,530 --> 00:29:47,920
Samara, Prince Darix loves me.

839
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:49,340
And if you'll only
 give your consent,

840
00:29:49,340 --> 00:29:50,500
we'll be married immediately.

841
00:29:50,500 --> 00:29:52,280
-Looks like this movie's
 equipped with airbags.

842
00:29:52,280 --> 00:29:52,780
-Booo.

843
00:29:52,780 --> 00:29:54,050
-Sorry, sorry.

844
00:29:54,050 --> 00:29:54,550
-Ow.

845
00:29:54,550 --> 00:29:55,430
-You can't refuse.

846
00:29:55,430 --> 00:29:56,660
-Of course not.

847
00:29:56,660 --> 00:29:58,260
How could I refuse you?

848
00:29:58,260 --> 00:29:59,190
-No, no, no, no, no!

849
00:29:59,190 --> 00:30:01,180
-In fact, I want you to marry.

850
00:30:01,180 --> 00:30:03,770
But not as soon
 as you would like.

851
00:30:03,770 --> 00:30:07,430
-Oh, Samara, why are
 you making us wait?

852
00:30:07,430 --> 00:30:09,600
-It's been my intention
 for a long time now

853
00:30:09,600 --> 00:30:11,730
to send Prince Darix
 to the court of Corrum

854
00:30:11,730 --> 00:30:13,640
to conduct secret negotiations.

855
00:30:13,640 --> 00:30:14,970
-Back in the frame, please.

856
00:30:14,970 --> 00:30:16,330
-On a matter of the
 greatest delicacy.

857
00:30:16,330 --> 00:30:18,130
-Toilet paper.

858
00:30:18,130 --> 00:30:19,550
-But he'll be back soon.

859
00:30:19,550 --> 00:30:20,740
And you'll live
 happily ever after.

860
00:30:20,740 --> 00:30:21,240
-The end

861
00:30:21,240 --> 00:30:22,480
-Oh, thank you.

862
00:30:22,480 --> 00:30:23,390
Thank you, dear sister.

863
00:30:23,390 --> 00:30:24,790
-Um-- Leave the ring, please.

864
00:30:24,790 --> 00:30:26,800
-He'll be leaving first
 thing tomorrow morning.

865
00:30:26,800 --> 00:30:29,250
Though he'll be away from you,
 it won't be for very long.

866
00:30:29,250 --> 00:30:30,220
-Do-si-do with an evil queen!

867
00:30:30,220 --> 00:30:30,850
-Are you satisfied?

868
00:30:30,850 --> 00:30:32,680
-Oh, I'm so happy.

869
00:30:32,680 --> 00:30:33,590
-Not for long.

870
00:30:36,470 --> 00:30:38,000
-Gladius is dead.

871
00:30:38,000 --> 00:30:39,220
Hercules has disappeared.

872
00:30:39,220 --> 00:30:40,050
-And I'm outta here.

873
00:30:40,050 --> 00:30:41,920
-The two of them were
 the only hope we had.

874
00:30:41,920 --> 00:30:43,320
There's nothing left to do.

875
00:30:43,320 --> 00:30:45,430
-You can talk that way because
 you don't have children.

876
00:30:45,430 --> 00:30:47,650
But if you had a
 daughter like my child

877
00:30:47,650 --> 00:30:50,650
you'd understand the
 anguish that a mother feels

878
00:30:50,650 --> 00:30:51,980
then the moon is
 full and you know

879
00:30:51,980 --> 00:30:54,420
they're coming to take
 her away to the sacrifice.

880
00:30:54,420 --> 00:30:55,450
I know what it is.
 -It's Lee Merriweather.

881
00:30:55,450 --> 00:30:55,950
[WHISTLING]

882
00:30:55,950 --> 00:30:56,710
-My wife is right.

883
00:30:56,710 --> 00:30:58,200
We can't bear living this way.

884
00:30:58,200 --> 00:30:59,060
-Mickey-- Mickey Rourke
 [APPLAUSE]

885
00:30:59,060 --> 00:31:00,380
-Anthrias, you're
 the only one who's

886
00:31:00,380 --> 00:31:02,010
been to the top of
 the mountain of death.

887
00:31:02,010 --> 00:31:03,650
Tell them what
 happened to you there.

888
00:31:03,650 --> 00:31:04,440
Speak out.

889
00:31:04,440 --> 00:31:07,000
Tell us whether ordinary men
 can overcome the monsters.

890
00:31:07,000 --> 00:31:08,910
-I saw the mountain
 open up miraculously

891
00:31:08,910 --> 00:31:10,700
and I was bathed in a
 blinding green light.

892
00:31:10,700 --> 00:31:11,200
-It was great

893
00:31:11,200 --> 00:31:14,000
-Then huge, deformed
 rock-like creatures appeared.

894
00:31:14,000 --> 00:31:15,790
And at the same
 time I was deafened

895
00:31:15,790 --> 00:31:17,260
by a weird sound
 that seemed to come

896
00:31:17,260 --> 00:31:18,730
from the depths of the earth.

897
00:31:18,730 --> 00:31:20,340
After that I don't
 remember anything.

898
00:31:20,340 --> 00:31:23,030
I was so terrified I
 was robbed of my senses.

899
00:31:23,030 --> 00:31:24,160
I came to after a while.

900
00:31:24,160 --> 00:31:25,660
And I found I was alone.

901
00:31:25,660 --> 00:31:27,390
-You experience only
 confirms the fact

902
00:31:27,390 --> 00:31:29,260
that it will not be
 easy for us to win.

903
00:31:29,260 --> 00:31:30,090
-I think it's useless.

904
00:31:30,090 --> 00:31:31,380
-Harvey Korman. [APPLAUSE]

905
00:31:31,380 --> 00:31:32,580
Only Hercules can
 fight the monsters

906
00:31:32,580 --> 00:31:34,150
with any chance of surviving.

907
00:31:34,150 --> 00:31:35,360
-All I can say is this.

908
00:31:35,360 --> 00:31:36,940
I'm the cousin of the queen--

909
00:31:36,940 --> 00:31:37,730
-Roddy McDowall, Hey!

910
00:31:37,730 --> 00:31:38,830
-Whose attitude
 seems to indicate

911
00:31:38,830 --> 00:31:40,940
she's in love with our enemy.

912
00:31:40,940 --> 00:31:42,610
I swear to you that
 I'm not influenced

913
00:31:42,610 --> 00:31:44,170
by any personal ambition.

914
00:31:44,170 --> 00:31:46,120
The only thing I want
 is to liberate Samar

915
00:31:46,120 --> 00:31:47,710
from the nightmare
 that's oppressing us.

916
00:31:47,710 --> 00:31:48,610
-And to direct.

917
00:31:48,610 --> 00:31:50,800
-Then my wife and
 I will go away--

918
00:31:50,800 --> 00:31:53,520
asking nothing--
 expecting nothing.

919
00:31:53,520 --> 00:31:55,920
-Lee Majors, ladies
 and gentlemen!

920
00:31:55,920 --> 00:31:56,930
-My name is Timor.

921
00:31:56,930 --> 00:31:58,440
And it's on the
 list of those who've

922
00:31:58,440 --> 00:32:00,120
been selected as victims
 for the sacrifice.

923
00:32:00,120 --> 00:32:00,630
-Yeah, boohoo.

924
00:32:00,630 --> 00:32:03,110
-But I'd prefer to die in
 combat with the monsters,

925
00:32:03,110 --> 00:32:05,200
if my death will help
 to liberate Samar.

926
00:32:05,200 --> 00:32:07,490
-Robert Stack! [WHISTLING]

927
00:32:07,490 --> 00:32:07,990
-Quiet.

928
00:32:07,990 --> 00:32:09,920
Don't let them hear you.

929
00:32:09,920 --> 00:32:10,460
-Ex-nay.

930
00:32:10,460 --> 00:32:12,390
Uh-- we were doing nothing.

931
00:32:12,390 --> 00:32:13,070
It's Clevious.

932
00:32:13,070 --> 00:32:15,200
He's doing it all.

933
00:32:15,200 --> 00:32:16,300
-Paul Sorvino!

934
00:32:16,300 --> 00:32:17,750
[APPLAUSE AND WHISTLING]

935
00:32:17,750 --> 00:32:18,720
-Who is it?

936
00:32:18,720 --> 00:32:20,520
-It's I, Agar-- with a friend.

937
00:32:20,520 --> 00:32:21,400
-Agarn?

938
00:32:21,400 --> 00:32:23,210
-Hm?

939
00:32:23,210 --> 00:32:24,730
-Marlow Thomas,
 ladies and gentlemen!

940
00:32:24,730 --> 00:32:25,260
Marlow Thomas!

941
00:32:25,260 --> 00:32:26,310
[APPLAUSE AND WHISTLING]
 -It's Hercules.

942
00:32:26,310 --> 00:32:26,900
We're saved!

943
00:32:26,900 --> 00:32:29,310
-Welcome Hercules!

944
00:32:29,310 --> 00:32:30,590
-Oh, it's Herc and
 he's got the keg.

945
00:32:30,590 --> 00:32:32,820
-I'm glad you're with
 us safe and sound.

946
00:32:32,820 --> 00:32:33,730
Our worries are over.

947
00:32:33,730 --> 00:32:35,800
With you leading us we will win.

948
00:32:35,800 --> 00:32:36,890
-Let me present Prince Darix.

949
00:32:36,890 --> 00:32:37,390
-Prince.

950
00:32:37,390 --> 00:32:38,200
[CLAPPING]

951
00:32:38,200 --> 00:32:39,850
--Gladius thought very
 highly of you, prince.

952
00:32:39,850 --> 00:32:42,100
We'll get along well together.

953
00:32:42,100 --> 00:32:44,050
[SQUEAKING]

954
00:32:44,050 --> 00:32:45,190
-Uh-- Herc, you got hat hair.

955
00:32:45,190 --> 00:32:47,790
-I know of the tragic
 destiny that hangs over you.

956
00:32:47,790 --> 00:32:50,740
But what would happen if
 one day the people of Samar

957
00:32:50,740 --> 00:32:53,500
were to refuse to send
 the sacrificial victims

958
00:32:53,500 --> 00:32:54,590
to the monsters in the mountain?

959
00:32:54,590 --> 00:32:55,960
-I think it would go
 something like this.

960
00:32:55,960 --> 00:33:01,690
[THEME MUSIC]

961
00:33:01,690 --> 00:33:03,100
-I never thought
 the time would come

962
00:33:03,100 --> 00:33:04,570
when I would greet
 you with such joy

963
00:33:04,570 --> 00:33:07,260
and in the same breath
 have to say goodbye.

964
00:33:07,260 --> 00:33:08,790
-Watch and you will
 see that my horse

965
00:33:08,790 --> 00:33:11,310
will fly on the
 wind like Pegasus.

966
00:33:11,310 --> 00:33:13,700
-Take care of yourself
 and come back soon.

967
00:33:13,700 --> 00:33:15,550
When can I hope
 to see you again?

968
00:33:15,550 --> 00:33:16,180
-In a few days.

969
00:33:16,180 --> 00:33:16,810
-Soon.

970
00:33:16,810 --> 00:33:18,560
-Have you spoken of
 us to Queen Samara?

971
00:33:18,560 --> 00:33:20,580
-Yes, when she was giving
 me the instructions

972
00:33:20,580 --> 00:33:22,540
for the mission I'm to
 carry out for her in Corrum

973
00:33:22,540 --> 00:33:24,880
she made several references
 to our marriage plans.

974
00:33:24,880 --> 00:33:25,380
-Pssst.

975
00:33:25,380 --> 00:33:26,310
Hey, Chuck you getting this?

976
00:33:26,310 --> 00:33:28,900
-But the way your sister spoke
 it seems she has no objections.

977
00:33:28,900 --> 00:33:31,030
They're sending me
 off as her ambassador

978
00:33:31,030 --> 00:33:31,990
with such good faith.

979
00:33:31,990 --> 00:33:33,780
-Well now you're the
 most important relative

980
00:33:33,780 --> 00:33:34,470
of the queen.

981
00:33:34,470 --> 00:33:35,400
-Hah, you really think so?

982
00:33:35,400 --> 00:33:35,960
-You're right.

983
00:33:35,960 --> 00:33:37,540
It's late and I must go.

984
00:33:37,540 --> 00:33:38,040
-Kiss her!

985
00:33:38,040 --> 00:33:38,800
Kiss her!

986
00:33:38,800 --> 00:33:39,860
Kiss her-- Come on.

987
00:33:39,860 --> 00:33:43,710
Why doncha kiss her instead
 of talking her to death.

988
00:33:43,710 --> 00:33:45,840
-Can we have a platonic
 relationship before Plato?

989
00:33:45,840 --> 00:33:49,130
-Not a minute longer.

990
00:33:49,130 --> 00:33:50,090
-She's all gassed up, sir.

991
00:33:50,090 --> 00:33:51,500
I vacuumed the inside too.

992
00:33:51,500 --> 00:33:52,000
-Oooh!

993
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:53,780
-Ooh!

994
00:33:53,780 --> 00:33:57,470
-I have regular saddles with
 blankets sewn over them.

995
00:33:57,470 --> 00:33:58,800
-Have fun storming the castle.

996
00:34:06,900 --> 00:34:08,500
-Is it true that Darix
 has been sent away

997
00:34:08,500 --> 00:34:09,920
on orders from the queen?

998
00:34:09,920 --> 00:34:10,420
-Yes.

999
00:34:10,420 --> 00:34:12,620
-I might have known she'd
 do something like that.

1000
00:34:12,620 --> 00:34:13,550
-What are you trying to say?

1001
00:34:13,550 --> 00:34:14,050
-He's toast.

1002
00:34:14,050 --> 00:34:15,350
-I don't wish to
 alarm you, Billis.

1003
00:34:15,350 --> 00:34:17,240
But I think it's
 necessary you be told.

1004
00:34:17,240 --> 00:34:20,290
The queen's aware that Darix is
 taking part in the conspiracy.

1005
00:34:20,290 --> 00:34:21,290
-But you think he's in danger?

1006
00:34:21,290 --> 00:34:22,920
-Yes, I think he's
 walking into a trap.

1007
00:34:22,920 --> 00:34:23,610
-Oh, Agar.

1008
00:34:23,610 --> 00:34:25,450
-Don't give up hope, princess.

1009
00:34:25,450 --> 00:34:26,390
Come with me.

1010
00:34:26,390 --> 00:34:28,340
I know a man who's powerful
 enough to help us both.

1011
00:34:28,340 --> 00:34:29,950
And I'm sure he
 won't refuse you.

1012
00:34:29,950 --> 00:34:33,990
-He's really reasonable and
 won't charge for the extras.

1013
00:34:33,990 --> 00:34:37,510
-Oh, Rick's playing
 cartoon tag over there.

1014
00:34:37,510 --> 00:34:39,200
-They're devolving.

1015
00:34:39,200 --> 00:34:39,700
-Oooh.

1016
00:34:42,620 --> 00:34:43,790
-Isn't he worried
 dirt's gonna skip

1017
00:34:43,790 --> 00:34:45,050
to all that oil he's got on?

1018
00:34:47,760 --> 00:34:50,570
-Along that road they take
 the victims to the sacrifice.

1019
00:34:50,570 --> 00:34:52,920
Beyond those woods and
 rivers, the mountain of death.

1020
00:34:52,920 --> 00:34:55,580
-Let's buy a pass so we
 can go on all the rides.

1021
00:34:55,580 --> 00:34:56,970
-Hercules!

1022
00:34:56,970 --> 00:35:00,290
-I thought you were out
 of town this weekend.

1023
00:35:00,290 --> 00:35:01,640
Zeus is on line three.

1024
00:35:01,640 --> 00:35:02,280
You wanna take him?

1025
00:35:02,280 --> 00:35:03,680
-They told me at the
 tavern you'd be here.

1026
00:35:03,680 --> 00:35:05,300
The Princess Billis
 needs your help.

1027
00:35:05,300 --> 00:35:06,280
-At your service.

1028
00:35:06,280 --> 00:35:08,930
-The queen has sent Darix
 away on a mission to Corrum..

1029
00:35:08,930 --> 00:35:10,090
-It's only a pretext.

1030
00:35:10,090 --> 00:35:12,500
She found out that Darix
 is one of the conspirators.

1031
00:35:12,500 --> 00:35:13,940
-TImor, get my horse-- fast.

1032
00:35:13,940 --> 00:35:14,940
-Get my fast horse.

1033
00:35:14,940 --> 00:35:16,510
-Darix is already on the
 on the road to Corrum?

1034
00:35:16,510 --> 00:35:18,060
-Yes, he left about an hour ago.

1035
00:35:18,060 --> 00:35:20,090
-Well, oh hi.

1036
00:35:20,090 --> 00:35:22,540
-You had better go back
 to the palace, princess.

1037
00:35:22,540 --> 00:35:23,130
Don't be afraid.

1038
00:35:26,720 --> 00:35:29,840
Even if it costs me my
 life, Darix will be saved.

1039
00:35:29,840 --> 00:35:30,550
-Hercules.

1040
00:35:30,550 --> 00:35:32,540
-Please don't go to
 any trouble for us.

1041
00:35:35,270 --> 00:35:37,300
-I give him three months.

1042
00:35:37,300 --> 00:35:38,690
-Herc, would you help us move?

1043
00:35:38,690 --> 00:35:40,780
-Even if it costs my life.

1044
00:35:40,780 --> 00:35:42,730
-I trust you to get them
 safely back to the city.

1045
00:35:42,730 --> 00:35:47,470
-Even if it costs you my
 life-- oh, never mind.

1046
00:35:47,470 --> 00:35:50,010
-Yeah, now Herc'll go
 to a bar for a few hours

1047
00:35:50,010 --> 00:35:51,860
and say he couldn't find them.

1048
00:35:51,860 --> 00:35:56,210
[CHUCKLING]

1049
00:35:56,210 --> 00:35:59,640
-(SINGING) She was
 calling wild fire.

1050
00:35:59,640 --> 00:36:01,570
Wild--

1051
00:36:01,570 --> 00:36:06,670
-Ow-- Ow-- Owie Owie-- Ow-- Ow--
 Ouch-- Ow-- Ouch-- Ow-- Owie--

1052
00:36:06,670 --> 00:36:09,070
Ouch--

1053
00:36:09,070 --> 00:36:12,430
-Ahh, then Corcorpium showed up.

1054
00:36:12,430 --> 00:36:13,390
-Hey-- Whoa.

1055
00:36:16,040 --> 00:36:18,340
